--- a/misaki_en/README.md
+++ b/misaki_en/README.md
@@ -0,0 +1,13 @@
+# Viola English-only Misaki fork
+
+Based on Misaki 0.9.4, Apache-2.0, with original attribution below.
+Only the English module, token representation and four English lexicons are retained.
+The distribution is named viola-misaki-en to distinguish it from upstream misaki.
+Do not co-install upstream misaki: both use the misaki import namespace.
+The caller must supply a local spaCy tagger and an English number converter.
+No eSpeak, phonemizer, num2words, transformer or downloaded fallback is included.
+The G2P algorithm and lexicons are retained with exact-decimal and currency-preservation fixes; unknown words remain explicit failures
+at the Viola customer adapter boundary. This does not qualify other languages.
+
+## Original upstream README (historical, not installation instructions)
+
